	<string>LiftOn reads your Apple Health workouts, heart rate, resting heart rate, active energy, steps, distance, exercise minutes, and sleep data to personalize your recovery insights, track your training streaks, and provide coaching recommendations. Workout data is securely stored in your account to enable recovery across devices.</string>
